result.description:
Masala Bite is a busy Indian restaurant in Innisfail seeking a skilled and reliable Cook to prepare high-quality dishes for our dine-in and takeaway service. This is an excellent opportunity for a qualified cook who takes pride in consistent, authentic cooking.
Key duties and responsibilities
?	Prepare, season and cook a range of Indian and contemporary dishes to the restaurant's standards and recipes;
?	Prepare curries, tandoori items, breads, rice dishes, entrées and accompaniments to order during service;
?	Portion, plate and present food attractively and consistently;
?	Monitor stock of ingredients, assist with ordering and take delivery of supplies;
?	Maintain a clean, safe and hygienic kitchen in line with food safety and WHS requirements;
?	Operate and maintain kitchen equipment safely; and
?	Assist with menu preparation and support other kitchen staff during busy periods.
Skills and experience required
?	A relevant qualification in commercial cookery (AQF Certificate III or higher), OR equivalent relevant work experience as a cook;
?	Demonstrated experience preparing Indian cuisine or similar high-volume à la carte cooking;
?	Sound knowledge of food safety, hygiene and kitchen WHS practices;
?	Ability to work efficiently under pressure during peak service;
?	Reliability, good teamwork and the flexibility to work evenings, weekends and public holidays on a rostered basis; and
?	Working rights in Australia (or eligibility to be sponsored).
?	Australian citizen and permanent resident are encouraged to apply.
